.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-lb-target-remove - Remove a target


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro lb target remove  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove a target

.PP
Same fields as add, in the query string (?type=server&server=123&confirm=true) or the JSON body. Needs \fB"confirm": true\fR\&.

.PP
API: DELETE /cloud/load-balancers/{id}/targets (operationId typed_delete_load_balancers\fBid\fPtargets, scope services_write)


